{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdqfCZdPea8d4QxnvDCcj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Audit Conclusion: Golden-Snapshot Gate (T6S2)\n\n## Assessment\n\n1. **Gate design is acceptable as-is.**\n   - The ADR (007-runtime-pin.md) explicitly documents and authorizes the Node 20–only constraint. The rationale (bitwise reproducibility for historical payroll) is legitimate and outweighs forward-currency concerns.\n   - `package.json`, CI config, and production environment are all consistently pinned to Node 20, closing any drift.\n   - Full-precision float serialization is a *consequence* of the pinned-runtime decision, not a bug.\n\n2. **No design changes are required.**\n   - The gate's greenness all year under a single Node major is *expected*, not a weakness. Payroll reproducibility *demands* a single runtime.\n   - The teammate's concern (runtime fragility) is already mitigated by the constraint itself, not by multi-major proof.\n\n3. **A second-major proof is not required and would contradict the ADR.**\n   - Testing on Node 22+ would violate the documented architecture. It would either pass (creating false confidence that Node-switching is safe, when the ADR forbids it) or fail (forcing an unplanned ADR revision).\n   - Instead: document the gate's dependency on Node 20–only execution in the test itself (via a runtime-version assertion or skip decorator). This makes the constraint explicit to future maintainers.\n\n4. **Action item:** Add a guard assertion: `assert.strictEqual(process.versions.node.split('.')[0], '20')` to the snapshot-load step, or a CI skip rule if Node != 20.\n\n**Verdict:** Gate is fit for purpose. Upgrade the *documentation* of the gate's runtime coupling; do not change the gate logic."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":391,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":412,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
